### FitLife Network - Authentication API

# Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7XXX
@token = 

### Login endpoint - Get JWT Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "gerente.general",
  "contrasena": "123456"
}

### Example: Login as Gerente Miembros
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "gerente.miembros",
  "contrasena": "123456"
}

### Example: Login as Vendedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "vendedor.mostrador",
  "contrasena": "123456"
}

### Protected endpoint example - Get Envios (replace with your actual endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/envios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
